From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:14:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/55] Guide overlay: the Xbox Live upsell
 (XamShowLiveUpsellUI)

The dashboard's Join Xbox Live and its Xbox Live banner call
XamShowLiveUpsellUI (undefined in Xenia, so nothing happened). It is a Guide
page: InfoUpsellLive.xur in the full-width Guide (hudbkgnd.xur ClosedToFull
/ FullToClosed: chrome and clock slide 1079, the page and legends appear at
the end, B closes). XamShowLiveSignupUI (Recover Gamertag) now fails cleanly
(no Xbox Live) instead of being an undefined import.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
